    `the transfer is treated as an issue of shares within s 32(5)` `the shares were held under subsection 32(1)` `the corporation transfers them`

-- s 32(6). No transfer of shares by a corporation is void, voidable or, in Quebec, null solely because the
-- transfer is in contravention of subsection (2).
