GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Is a transfer of shares by my corporation void or voidable just because it contravenes subsection 32(2)` IF
    `the transfer of shares is void, voidable or null within s 32(6)` `the transfer contravenes subsection 32(2)` `the transfer is void on another ground`

