      `the realizable value of our assets after the payment, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What would the realizable value of the corporation's assets be after the payment, in dollars?
      `our liabilities, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's liabilities, in dollars?
      `our stated capital of all classes, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the stated capital of all classes of the corporation, in dollars?
      `we are an open-end mutual fund` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the corporation an open-end mutual fund?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
