      `the realizable value of our assets after the payment, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What would the realizable value of the corporation's assets be after the payment, in dollars?
      `our liabilities, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the corporation's liabilities, in dollars?
      `the amount payable first on redemption or liquidation, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What amount would be required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares who have the right to be paid before the holders of the shares to be acquired, to the extent not already included in the liabilities, in dollars?
