            `reasonable grounds exist for believing that the corporation is, or would after the step be, unable to pay its liabilities as they become due` IS `there are grounds to believe we cannot pay our debts`
            `realizable value of the corporation's assets after the step, in dollars` IS `the realizable value of our assets after the payment, in dollars`
            `liabilities of the corporation, in dollars` IS `our liabilities, in dollars`
            `stated capital of all classes, in dollars` IS 0
            `amount required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares that must be paid before the shares to be acquired and not included in the liabilities, in dollars` IS `the amount payable first on redemption or liquidation, in dollars`
            `amount required, on a redemption or in a liquidation, to pay the holders of shares that must be paid rateably with or before the shares to be acquired and not included in the liabilities, in dollars` IS 0
            `the corporation is an open-end mutual fund` IS FALSE

-- s 35(3). A corporation shall not make any payment to purchase or acquire under subsection (1) shares issued by
-- it if there are reasonable grounds for believing that (a) it is, or would after the payment be, unable to pay
-- its liabilities as they become due, or (b) the realizable value of its assets would after the payment be less
-- than the aggregate of (i) its liabilities and (ii) the amount required for payment on a redemption or in a
-- liquidation of all shares whose holders have the right to be paid before the holders of the shares to be
